  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 67e749f2b7d7bc244ac0f5a2749ac2ee, type: 3}
  m_Name: TrojanHelmet
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::LetterData
  contentList:
  - I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  I've always dream of wearing
    this cool warrior headset. Dad told me that I need a hat for rainy days, and
    I think that's the perfect match! I hope you will understand.
  - "I hope you're excited for Christmas just like I am!  I\u2019ve always dreamed
    of wearing a knight\u2019s helmet. Dad says I need something for rainy days,
    and I think this heroic headgear is perfect. I hope you\u2019ll understand!"
  - "I hope your sleigh is almost ready for Christmas Eve!  I\u2019m wishing for
    a brave shell to protect my head, like the heroes of old."
